WEBVTT

00:05:29.621 --> 00:05:32.288
is that the police
and the mental health crisis team,

00:05:32.288 --> 00:05:33.663
they work together --

00:05:33.704 --> 00:05:34.871
in cahoots.

00:05:34.871 --> 00:05:37.746
An elite team of specialists
trained to respond

00:05:37.788 --> 00:05:40.579
to people having a mental health
or substance use crisis.

00:05:40.954 --> 00:05:43.163
See, it was the police
that convinced the man

00:05:43.163 --> 00:05:44.913
to surrender the box cutters.

00:05:45.288 --> 00:05:47.954
But it was the CAHOOTS team
that stepped up,

00:05:47.996 --> 00:05:50.829
connected the man
to resources and listened.

00:05:51.579 --> 00:05:54.288
You see, I have been fighting
for criminal justice reform

00:05:54.288 --> 00:05:55.996
my entire career.

00:05:56.038 --> 00:05:58.871
And sometimes, it can seem so daunting.

00:05:59.288 --> 00:06:03.788
There are 7,000 prisons and jails
across the United States,